# schema_changes.log

[2025-05-01] Removed assay_id from kit table; created assay_kit table
- Normalized many-to-many relationship between assays and kits
- Updated schema.sql accordingly
- No data migration needed since app is still in early development

[2025-04-15] Added qc and qc_analyte tables
- Created qc table to store quality control information
- Created qc_analyte table to store analyte-specific QC information
- Updated schema.sql to reflect new tables
